    },
    {
      "id": "E-OUTPUT-SCRIPT",
      "row": "| `E-OUTPUT-SCRIPT` | JavaScript artifacts are constructed before the first sink callback; callback order and `emittedFiles` stay independent. | `tsc_emitter::{emit_files_with_activity,EmitArtifact,MemoryOutputSink,FsOutputSink,EmitOutcome}` (public) | `active-qualified`; validation ref `0653e10d` (2026-08-17); candidate audit 2026-08-14 | H2.5g profile and H1 sink-failure controls |",
      "row_sha256": "b785ad8c4df4ec27f1ff4a0e242c4f9115d7095f6d446bf2dd8e2c4f9d966ae0",
